      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey prof, i'm trying to prep for my seminar on social contract theory and how it relates to modern tech. specifically, i'm looking at the whole debate around state surveillance for national security. can you explain the core philosophical tension between the right to privacy and the state's duty to protect its citizens within the framework of the social contract?",
